    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": \"## 🔗 Section 8: Full System Integration\\n\\n### AnamnezAI Complete Stack\\n\\n| Component | Technology | Purpose |\\n|-----------|-----------|---------|\\n| **AI Model** | Gemma 4 (`gemma4:e4b`) via Ollama | Interview + Triage + ICD-10 |\\n| **Vision AI** | MedGemma (`medgemma:4b`) via Ollama | Medical image analysis |\\n| **Backend** | FastAPI v5.0 + Python 3.11 | REST API + SSE streaming |\\n| **Vector DB** | ChromaDB + all-MiniLM-L6-v2 | RAG — 810+ medical guideline chunks |\\n| **Auth** | JWT + Google OAuth2 | 4-role RBAC (patient/doctor/nurse/admin) |\\n| **Storage** | SQLite | Sessions, summaries, audit log |\\n| **Standards** | MTS + CTAS + FHIR R4 + ICD-10 | Clinical interoperability |\\n| **Export** | FHIR R4 Bundle (JSON) | Hospital HIS integration |\\n| **Frontend** | Vanilla HTML/CSS/JS | PWA + offline support |\\n\\n### API Quick Reference\\n```bash\\n# 1. Verify Ollama proof-of-local\\ncurl http://localhost:8000/api/offline-proof\\n\\n# 2. Check health\\ncurl http://localhost:8000/health\\n\\n# 3. Check RAG status\\ncurl http://localhost:8000/api/rag/status\\n\\n# 4. Start patient interview\\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/session/start \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"patient_name\\\":\\\"Test Patient\\\",\\\"age\\\":45,\\\"gender\\\":\\\"Male\\\",\\\"language\\\":\\\"en\\\"}'\\n\\n# 5. Get triage summary\\ncurl http://localhost:8000/api/session/{session_id}/summary\\n\\n# 6. FHIR R4 export (doctor token required)\\ncurl http://localhost:8000/api/session/{session_id}/fhir \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Authorization: Bearer <doctor_token>\\\"\\n```\\n\"\n",
